@startuml
title SafetyLite application integration component view

component "Safety Application API" as AppAPI <<ARC-AppAPI>>
component "Task Supervisor" as TaskSupervisor <<ARC-TaskSupervisor>>
component "Priority Scheduler" as Scheduler <<ARC-Scheduler>>
component "IPC Manager" as IPC <<ARC-IPC>>
component "Time Service" as TimeService <<ARC-TimeService>>
component "Health Monitor" as Health <<ARC-HealthMonitor>>
component "Kernel Core" as Kernel <<ARC-Kernel>>
component "Brake Control Task" as BrakeTask <<APP-SafetyCritical>>
component "Steering Assist Task" as SteeringTask <<APP-SafetyCritical>>
component "Telemetry Task" as TelemetryTask <<APP-NonCritical>>
component "Diagnostic Request Task" as DiagnosticTask <<APP-Service>>

interface ActivateTask as IActivate
interface Checkpoint as ICheckpoint
interface QueueAPI as IQueue
interface EventFlagAPI as IEvent
interface TimeQuery as ITime
interface ServiceStatus as IStatus

BrakeTask --> IActivate : request activation
BrakeTask --> ICheckpoint : safety checkpoint
BrakeTask --> IQueue : actuator command queue
SteeringTask --> IActivate : request activation
SteeringTask --> ICheckpoint : safety checkpoint
TelemetryTask --> IQueue : publish status
TelemetryTask --> ITime : timestamp
DiagnosticTask --> IEvent : wait diagnostic event
DiagnosticTask --> IStatus : service result

IActivate --> AppAPI : validated service
ICheckpoint --> AppAPI : validated service
IQueue --> AppAPI : validated service
IEvent --> AppAPI : validated service
ITime --> AppAPI : validated service
IStatus --> AppAPI : status reporting

AppAPI --> Kernel : caller identity
AppAPI --> Scheduler : activation request
AppAPI --> IPC : queue/event operation
AppAPI --> TimeService : time query
AppAPI --> Health : checkpoint report
TaskSupervisor --> Health : missing checkpoint
Scheduler --> TaskSupervisor : dispatched task

note right of AppAPI: REQ-008 API-001 API-002 API-003 API-004 SAF-007
@enduml
